"steveyo" <steveyo@cannedmeat.nycap.rr.com> writes:

> If I change alignment on Astral, did I still ascend?  Does it count?

Yes. The Nethack gods don't care about which alignment you were born with,
only about which alignment is shown on your status line. The only creature
that cares about your alignment being the original one is your quest mentor.
And your original alignment isn't recorded in the record or logfile, so it
would be a bit difficult to make ascensions with changed alignment not
count for the tournament..

Of course, if you ascend as something like a chaotic valkyrie or a lawful
rogue, everybody who knows which classes can start with which alignments,
will KNOW you have changed alignment somewhere somehow.

